s": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": hence to limit, strengthen or amplify a general assertion, ἀνὴρ . . ὅστις πινυτός γε any man— at least any wise man, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.229", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; freq. preceded by καί, usu. with words intervening, ἦ μὴν κελεύσω κἀπιθωΰξω γε πρός ay and besi <*>es that . . , "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Pr. 73", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; παρῆσάν τινες καὶ πολλοί γε some, ay and a great many, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Phd. 58d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "καὶ γελοίως γε Id. R. 531a", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; freq. with the last term in an enumeration, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ταύτῃ ἄρα . . πρακτέον καὶ γυμναστέον καὶ ἐδεστέον γε καὶ ποτέον Id. Cri. 47b", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὄψεις τε καὶ ἀκοαὶ καὶ . . καὶ ἡδοναί γε δή Id. Tht. 156b", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; repeated, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "συνήγαγόν μοι καί γε ἀργύριον καί γε χρυσίον LXX Ec. 2.8", "author_abbreviation": "LXX", "tlg_author": "0527", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; rarely without intervening words, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "καί γε ὁ θάνατος διὰ τὴν μοίρην ἔλαχεν Hp. Septim. 9", "author_abbreviation": "Hp.", "tlg_author": "0627", "tlg_work": "034", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Lys. 11.7", "author_abbreviation": "