"0059", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; sts. ironically, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εὖ γε κηδεύεις πόλιν E. IT 1212", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "013", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". to heighten a contrast or opposition, after conditional clauses, εἰ μὲν δὴ σύ γ' . . , τῷ κε Ποσειδάων γε . . if you do so, then at all events Poseidon will . . , "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 15.49", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " sq.; ἐπεὶ πρὸς τοῦτο σιωπᾶν ἥδιόν σοι . . τόδε γε εἰπέ at any rate tell me this, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Cyr. 5.5.20", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰ μὴ τὸ ὅλον, μέρος γ' ἐπιβάλλει D. 18.272", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "018", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ":—sts. in the protasis, εἰ γὰρ μὴ ἑκόντες γε . . ἀλλ' ἀέκοντας . . "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 4.120", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". in disjunctive sentences to emphasize an alternative, ἤτοι κεῖνόν γε . . δεῖ ἀπόλλυσθαι ἢ σέ . . "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. 1.11", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἤτοι κρίνομέν γε ἢ ἐνθυμούμεθα ὀρθῶς τὰ πράγματα Th. 2.40", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "πατὴρ δ' ἐμός . . ζώει ὅ γ' ἢ τέθνηκε Od. 2.131", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 10.504", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": also in the second clause, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰπέ μοι, ἠὲ ἑκὼν ὑποδάμνασαι ἤ σέ γε λαοὶ ἐχθαίρουσι Od. 3.214", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 7.10", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". θ ́, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. OT 1098", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " sq. in exclamations, etc., ὥς γε μή ποτ' ὤφελον λαβεῖν dub. in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. IA 70", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "018", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. OC 977", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ph. 1003", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Ach. 93", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "836", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; in oaths, οὔτοι μὰ τὴν Δήμητρά γ' v.l. in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Eq. 698", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μὰ τὸν Ποσειδῶ γ' οὐδέποτ' Id. Ec. 748", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "καὶ ναὶ μὰ Δία γε X. Ap. 20", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "καὶ νὴ Δία γε Ar. Eq. 1350", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "D.Chr. 17.4", "author_abbreviation": "D.Chr.", "tlg_author": "0612", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Luc. Merc.Cond. 28", "author_abbreviation": "Luc.", "tlg_author": "0062", "tlg_work": "033", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Lib. Or. 11.59", "author_abbreviation": "Lib.", "tlg_author": "2200", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.: with words intervening, καὶ νὴ Δί', ὦ ἄνδρες Ἀθηναῖοι, ἕτεροί γε . . "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "D. 13.16", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "013", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "νὴ Δία, ὦ Ἀθηναῖοι, ὥρα γε ὑμῖν X. HG 7.1.37", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; merely in strong assertions, τίς ἂν φιλέοντι μάχοιτο; ἄφρων δὴ κεῖνός γέ . . "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 8.209", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. implying concession, εἶμί γε well then I will go (in apodosi), "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. HF 861", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δρᾶ γ' εἴ τι δράσεις Id. IA 817", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "018", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Andr. 239", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". γε freq. repeated in protasis and apodosis, as πρίν γε . . , πρίν γε, v. supr. 1.3; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰ μή γε . . τινὶ μείζονι, τῇ γε παρούσῃ ἀτιμίᾳ Lys. 31.29", "author_abbreviation": "Lys.", "tlg_author": "0540", "tlg_work": "031", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; even in the same clause, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐδέν γ' ἄλλο πλήν γε καρκίνους Ar. V. 1507", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 1.187", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. Ph. 554", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "015", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. R. 335b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Grg. 502a", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "023", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". POSITION: γε normally follows the word which it limits; but is freq. placed immediately after the Article, as "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὅ γε πόλεμος Th. 1.66", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; or the Prep., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "κατά γε τὸν σὸν λόγον X. Cyr. 3.1.15", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἔν γε ταῖς Θήβαις S. OT 1380", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; or "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δέ, νῦν δέ γε Pl. Tht. 144e", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τὸ δέ γε ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "164b", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "δοῖμεν δέ γέ που ἄν Id. R. 607d", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Phd. 94a", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; freq. in retorts, ἁμές ποκ' ἦμες ἄλκιμοι νεανίαι. Answ. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἁμὲς δέ γ' εἰμές Carm.Pop. 18", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; οὐκ οἶδ' ὅτι λέγεις. Answ. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἡ γραῦς δέ γε οἶδ', ὡς ἐγῷμαι Men. Epit. 577", "author_abbreviation": "Men.", "tlg_author": "0541", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Th. 1031", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. "}]}